00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.680
Shut up!
Hurry up, shut her mouth!

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.600
But she bites!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.980
If only you hadn't come here...
Go home!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:02.190
